      "text": "Alma2 preaches at Ammonihah, Alma 8:6–8 (9:1). land of Ammonihah named after first possessor, Alma 8:7. Alma2 cast out of Ammonihah, Alma 8:9–13. Alma2 returns to Ammonihah, Alma 8:16–18. words of Alma2 and Amulek to people at Ammonihah, Alma 9–14. destruction of people predicted, Alma 10:23. people at Ammonihah burn scriptures, slay believers, Alma 14:8. Alma2 and Amulek are imprisoned, Alma 14:22. falling prison walls slay leaders, Alma 14:27. Alma2 and Amulek are freed, Alma 14:28. people flee from prophets, Alma 14:29. Alma2 and Amulek banished from Ammonihah, Alma 15:1. people remain hard-hearted, Alma 15:15. Lamanites destroy people of Ammonihah, Alma 16:2–3, 9 (25:2). called Desolation of Nehors, Alma 16:11. rebuilt, Alma 49:3. Lamanites dare not attack Ammonihah, Alma 49:10–11.",
